 分左右的结果。另一个系统通常得分为 60 分，但偶尔会发现得分为 100 分的特殊解决方案。如果允许我们对人工智能进行多次采样并选择最佳结果，那么第二个系统可能会更有价值。&lt;img src="https://arxiv.org/abs/2609" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 19:12:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/tail-likelihood-reinforcement-learning-teaching-ai-to-keep-its-best-possibilities-alive</guid></item><item><title>迄今为止最冷的熔岩世界，有大气层的迹象，为早期地球提供了线索</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/coolest-lava-world-yet-with-signs-of-an-atmosphere-offers-clues-to-early-earth</link><description>在寻找外星生命时，首先寻找具有大气层的岩石行星（例如地球）是有意义的。没有大气层，行星就不可能有地表水。但迄今为止已编录的 6,300 多颗系外行星中，绝大多数都不是岩石世界，只有少数岩石世界似乎拥有大气层。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/coolest-lava-world-yet-with-signs-of-an-atmosphere-offers-clues-to-early-earth.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 18:57:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/coolest-lava-world-yet-with-signs-of-an-atmosphere-offers-clues-to-early-earth</guid></item><item><title>10XMe·真正为你服务的AI</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/10xme-%c2%b7-ai-that-actually-works-for-you</link><description>有没有想过人工智能“代理”与基本聊天机器人到底有何不同？ 🤖💡&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/10xme-c2b7-ai-that-actually-works-for-you.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 18:42:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/10xme-%c2%b7-ai-that-actually-works-for-you</guid></item><item><title>放射治疗如何杀死癌细胞：什么时候开始起作用？</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/how-radiation-therapy-kills-cancer-cells-when-does-it-start-working</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 18:27:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/how-radiation-therapy-kills-cancer-cells-when-does-it-start-working</guid></item><item><title>咖啡灌肠致直肠烧伤、直肠结肠炎、亚急性肠梗阻、电解质失衡一例报告</title><l